      name: "Big Garff",
      imageSrc: kittyCityBigGarff,
      altText: "A wide, rounded gray cat with a flattened oval body and short legs, smiling calmly. Evenly spaced stripes radiate across its back and underside, and a small splotched tail curls upward behind it. Across the back, the upper row of stripes is arranged from left to right as white, black, black, white, black, white, black, black, black. Across the belly, the lower row of stripes is arranged from left to right as black, black, black, black, black, black, black, white, black, white.",
