      friendlyDescription: "{{name}} is too lazy to solve puzzles the traditional way. It prefers to backsolve or Wheel-of-Fortune whenever possible. Word has it that {{name}} migrated to Kitty City from Elder Drifts, earning animosity from its neighbors early on, <i>who have since apologized. Now he enjoys lazing around with old friends and new friends alike.</i>",
