      pronunciationSrc: elderDriftsFelixothPronunciationSrc,
      description: "{{name}} likes math.",
      favoriteQuote: "I knew it the moment I came upon it at the bottom of a spacious valley; for no other name could fit such a thing, or any other thing fit such a name.",
